  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDEAS conference on evaluation of SDGs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IDEAS konferens om utv&#xe4;rdering av SDG m&#xe5;len</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser st&#xf6;d till deltare fr&#xe5;n globala s&#xf6;dern, framf&#xf6;r allt Afrika, i den konferens om utv&#xe4;rdering av SDG m&#xe5;len som h&#xe5;lls i Mexico i december 2017, coh som anordnas av det globala n&#xe4;tverket f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rdering inom bist&#xe5;ndet, International Developmet Evaluation Association (IDEAS), tillsammans med n&#xe5;gra regionala n&#xe4;tverk p&#xe5; samma tema.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution supports participants from the Global South, primairly Africa, to attend a conference on evaluation of the SDGS that will be held in Mexico in December 2017. The conference is organized by the International Developmnet Evaluation Association, a gobal network for evaluation of international aid, in collaboration with a few regional networks with similiar profiles.</narrative>
  </description>
